  "lang": "uk",
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "006ab27",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Але мені не вистачає 7 фотографій про мости та човни на Сені!",
      "sourceEnText": "But I miss 7 photos about bridges and boats on the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_006ab27.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4284,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:17Z",
      "textHash": "1675fdf876f3ce93b66f09f5c7322b386974d37f08c4ede8c54fd388292fbb83"
    },
    {
      "key": "00728bb",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_boat_guide",
      "sourceText": "Плавучий будинок може бути домівкою.",
      "sourceEnText": "A houseboat can be a home.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_00728bb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:39Z",
      "textHash": "c56eee3001862d96f253ce3fbfc7e6964a7fa375b996583645d995a263f4715e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0129c99",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Цей човен має великі вікна. Туристи можуть милуватися містом. Це «річковий човен».",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat has large windows. Tourists can admire the city. It's a \"riverboat\".",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0129c99.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5904,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:15Z",
      "textHash": "2385e6f93977c05c08e6b4bc2c653dc55ee04c2df5add0f89ad9ef6bea78ddd2"
    },
    {
      "key": "0165157",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Чому цей човен називають хаусботом?",
      "sourceEnText": "Why is this boat called a houseboat?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0165157.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:09Z",
      "textHash": "6ff76e8cdf53de572656361bb9c3b2b482f2811d46808cd97bd4c51dd9f75cc6"
    },
    {
      "key": "01663fa",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_train",
      "sourceText": "Я б дуже хотів покататися поїздом!",
      "sourceEnText": "I would love to ride a train!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_01663fa.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:47Z",
      "textHash": "9a540e935ae2454796dce5199b0c139455031db0c21aac8d773294084bea9d70"
    },
    {
      "key": "018a0eb",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Дуже сильний",
      "sourceEnText": "Very strong",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_018a0eb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:42Z",
      "textHash": "cd7002b70296e5b416163bc4e9081fa37a23253348a8e78c7593a70c1d8f5668"
    },
    {
      "key": "01f30c4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Машини їдуть швидко. Як мені безпечно перейти дорогу?",
      "sourceEnText": "The cars are driving fast. How can I cross safely?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_01f30c4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4284,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:33Z",
      "textHash": "3d0ccf19d0108a5ccbaa0d2fd102078e6518418ffe8c62978b42e865c6270996"
    },
    {
      "key": "0210ef0",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Я відвідую Париж. Я турист. Пес Антура взяв мою книгу про Париж!",
      "sourceEnText": "I'm visiting Paris. I'm a tourist. Antura the dog took my book about Paris!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0210ef0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5956,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:25Z",
      "textHash": "24342ea284432214e0f59f16320de0a6c5330979add4ad71c3635d1b2d676622"
    },
    {
      "key": "021f382",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Чому цей міст знаменитий?",
      "sourceEnText": "What is special about this famous bridge?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_021f382.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:25Z",
      "textHash": "6614cc3da1e1e89a7b89ec695eaff38b9dbb3b939c49a1e04cef3771dbe63ec4"
    },
    {
      "key": "02349a3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Для перевезення автомобілів",
      "sourceEnText": "To transport cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02349a3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:20Z",
      "textHash": "b14328449ba52b0ccc1595d8978346387edafdb6520e33bd391060977bd25b1e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0280e8f",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Сьогодні ви відкриєте для себе Сену та її численні мости. На Сені є всілякі човни.",
      "sourceEnText": "Today, you will discover the Seine and its many bridges. On the Seine, there are all kinds of boats.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0280e8f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6896,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:00Z",
      "textHash": "8ba74962c04450c12ccb5e6f7a5b537dd10d89b3a503dc648801cfc4f321303b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0281b33",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Сена впадає в Ла-Манш (море) у північному напрямку.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine flows into the English Channel (a sea) in a northerly direction.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0281b33.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4153,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:00Z",
      "textHash": "c0c82c2435fd65496bfeb170f6ea51e28722f0f11c28a94345fc7c37e0739926"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ab1e0",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Середземне море",
      "sourceEnText": "The Mediterranean Sea",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ab1e0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1463,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:35Z",
      "textHash": "3e5bb7dd27e77014d6855f0dcfc2fa999fbe5427033222f72f3e48b4d2966e93"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ce3de",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Чому у туристичного човна великі вікна?",
      "sourceEnText": "Why does a tourist boat have big windows?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ce3de.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3318,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:17Z",
      "textHash": "69ac9aa755c050be97060f0e8dceff2797126ef66defd9310ef02a368d269d6f"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ed36d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "Я бачив собаку, що гуляв, так.",
      "sourceEnText": "I did see a dog walking around, yes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ed36d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2247,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:05Z",
      "textHash": "3be996538e981ec54ce66c19a75d82b1906c9c14f8447d393492eca1c4fbc71b"
    },
    {
      "key": "036ba15",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Цей човен перевозить товари",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat is transporting goods",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_036ba15.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2064,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:14Z",
      "textHash": "539e77e100ff44de6e6eb4f7ccd652960b7512f32c600b36e5266aa75bd21e72"
    },
    {
      "key": "037efcf",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Піти під воду",
      "sourceEnText": "To go under the water",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_037efcf.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1228,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:22Z",
      "textHash": "3eaefe6e434d52a2814c6d3f13445c3b856f8999d3105ef8b42f2010038b8114"
    },
    {
      "key": "038b8f6",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_woman",
      "sourceText": "У Парижі багато мостів!",
      "sourceEnText": "There are many bridges in Paris!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_038b8f6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:16Z",
      "textHash": "bda6625764bcfed2a9750a85c4ed491497918feb54915fc859930e6cbcf6062d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0395113",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Сена дуже довга!",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine is very long!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0395113.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1411,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:23Z",
      "textHash": "b276322c47260b542798534d7e6f8032f3e22ad48ab57b70ce160fca04668201"
    },
    {
      "key": "03c92db",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Англійський канал",
      "sourceEnText": "The English Channel",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03c92db.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:38Z",
      "textHash": "d99d138e6705337f4d513e95d357dbe2bd10b809557ae58edd39f4c3a3cb85cb"
    },
    {
      "key": "03e5667",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_ile_de_france",
      "sourceText": "Є острів Іль-де-ла-Сіте.",
      "sourceEnText": "There is an island called Île de la Cité.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03e5667.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:08Z",
      "textHash": "90396fffd05354a836d7d4f3d92880a27944469452021cac9053becf21c726b2"
    },
    {
      "key": "03ea48b",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "У тебе все добре!",
      "sourceEnText": "You are doing well!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03ea48b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:22Z",
      "textHash": "e4b499b7bfe5a480c973a7a58b00ad4174413c28bb898833f4b4c3f9e32f37a7"
    },
    {
      "key": "03ff912",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Тільки для прогулянок",
      "sourceEnText": "Only for walking",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03ff912.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:46Z",
      "textHash": "7529b5bd90b4a9c9d0c34515debf4a31b823e51ca191d8ca4c46053dfa34a44c"
    },
    {
      "key": "04059bd",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Що можна знайти на товарному судні?",
      "sourceEnText": "What can you find on a goods boat?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_04059bd.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2717,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:45Z",
      "textHash": "938ad5ec689faac3ba75e36040e71f644a082b5eb75307ab941e97469908dc4a"
    },
    {
      "key": "042160f",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Ласкаво просимо до Парижа! Париж — столиця Франції. У Парижі є дуже відома річка. Ця річка називається Сена.",
      "sourceEnText": "Welcome to Paris! Paris is the capital of France. In Paris, there is a very famous river. This river is called the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_042160f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 9169,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:58Z",
      "textHash": "f93485416433ef1a8297043e9589fd711ee8fe76f972e6869922b096db5dbed0"
    },
    {
      "key": "0454688",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Побачити місто та відомі місця",
      "sourceEnText": "To see the city and famous places",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0454688.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2664,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:19Z",
      "textHash": "52f1f9375b55921c979e3776f51ed95f4be7e5a204793e302434145055df5d4f"
    },
    {
      "key": "047502b",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_boat_guide",
      "sourceText": "Туристичні човни мають великі вікна.",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourist boats have large windows.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_047502b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3082,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:36Z",
      "textHash": "96ef7b80fe57b281acf59814df1fe5aa4c036b45cc825588b76556dd4c011067"
    },
    {
      "key": "0484ee9",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "Міст, по якому можуть ходити лише люди, називається...",
      "sourceEnText": "A bridge only for people to walk on is called a...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0484ee9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3448,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:52Z",
      "textHash": "bd956f8fdc03609e71aad12344094c7b0eefe27ac57eafa4bfcdadd47a15c4c8"
    },
    {
      "key": "0494564",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Мені дуже подобається їздити на велосипеді вздовж Сени!",
      "sourceEnText": "I really enjoy cycling along the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0494564.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 4023,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:20Z",
      "textHash": "7787841ad9c39e370ad306bf127e2204e3341c9782a2cb0bc23c9c289e87648f"
    },
    {
      "key": "04b2cf2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_ile_de_france",
      "sourceText": "Він знаходиться у старому центрі Парижа.",
      "sourceEnText": "It is in the old center of Paris.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_04b2cf2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2769,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:10Z",
      "textHash": "1ba835daa8163ed46774128e804c440faea4b20a3c9583a039155ec8bdc4395b"
    },
    {
      "key": "052fdac",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Атлантичний океан",
      "sourceEnText": "The Atlantic Ocean",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_052fdac.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:42Z",
      "textHash": "ecd1581bb0f30dd33fac4efaf8414bf5f89698e3d72b1a1332bad493522b3e9d"
    },
    {
      "key": "055d822",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Це міст для поїздів.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_055d822.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1724,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:12Z",
      "textHash": "d398dd354b069dcbedccaba56c6b3ca6af093caa48c77f8d79b50890166c85fa"
    },
    {
      "key": "056c933",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Є статуї, зроблені із золота.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are statues made of gold.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_056c933.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:27Z",
      "textHash": "7aa43585be17686b56f700c451b75463692a0a4434c5e95451abf0a29f89839d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0574872",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_train",
      "sourceText": "Я люблю поїзди!",
      "sourceEnText": "I love trains!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0574872.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:49Z",
      "textHash": "035af2bea79f676d7436a40131689dc555e69baadd66b7cf2a791ae880eb42c8"
    },
    {
      "key": "059f66d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_eiffel",
      "sourceText": "Дивись, яке воно гарне!",
      "sourceEnText": "Look how pretty it is!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_059f66d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1724,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:07Z",
      "textHash": "fb763a2061f5afc9aa62af885b5414771d9a3f98e5f1ea65d86e317510662ddd"
    },
    {
      "key": "05c2518",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Це міст для поїздів.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_05c2518.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:28Z",
      "textHash": "d398dd354b069dcbedccaba56c6b3ca6af093caa48c77f8d79b50890166c85fa"
    },
    {
      "key": "0614aef",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "Ні, я не бачив твого собаку.",
      "sourceEnText": "No, I haven't seen your dog.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0614aef.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:02Z",
      "textHash": "b351b7dc6d60c7087e03c3083b9514852b517afe4012b22c7e5114ba726cdd52"
    },
    {
      "key": "062cc35",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Є човни для туристів. У них є великі вікна, через які можна побачити пам'ятки Парижа з боку Сени.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are boats for tourists. They have large windows to see the monuments of Paris from the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_062cc35.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7079,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:05Z",
      "textHash": "b3c13b5d246364803ab05f6fd84d908d5228c7e286c6ca859d24ab5d4e6562b7"
    },
    {
      "key": "06638a3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Вагони поїзда",
      "sourceEnText": "Train cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06638a3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:56Z",
      "textHash": "e4b32430e36d01b91d71d790a57ed8008754f4002e8dbb9d6d677fa7b24e1fd6"
    },
    {
      "key": "066d7bd",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Річка, що протікає через Париж, називається...",
      "sourceEnText": "The river that flows through Paris is called...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_066d7bd.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3814,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:34Z",
      "textHash": "6ca3d2377b84331241ac8ff4a4e920d38932b2cad0021f758c7ccddfd4a5136a"
    },
    {
      "key": "06aa0c1",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Привіт!",
      "sourceEnText": "Hi!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06aa0c1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 888,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:18Z",
      "textHash": "7ef2ddee4c47aa8c3e8a57bcc39f887fa136b2c67c972a205ac5813089c24377"
    },
    {
      "key": "06d2470",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_river_friend",
      "sourceText": "На картах показано меандри річки.",
      "sourceEnText": "The maps show the meanders of the river.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06d2470.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:32Z",
      "textHash": "04916cef9fbc62eabeb62e55f8bfc732a300dd1b6711de0c6790a0b5e376499c"
    },
    {
      "key": "072a345",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_woman",
      "sourceText": "Доброго ранку!",
      "sourceEnText": "Good morning!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_072a345.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:13Z",
      "textHash": "1ecbfacd15898cf4e16e176fe5fb9c8a95564f554c6d070535ddb46a333998f5"
    },
    {
      "key": "074efa5",
      "nodeTitle": "facts_river",
      "sourceText": "Сена впадає в Ла-Манш.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine flows into the English Channel.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_074efa5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:12Z",
      "textHash": "4f7b460ef0a2d1e4536e57a9033f5175c3a67c8bdc2748fc027e07a6197ffd35"
    },
    {
      "key": "076ee7f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Ви можете переходити дорогу будь-де.",
      "sourceEnText": "You can cross the road anywhere.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_076ee7f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:36Z",
      "textHash": "7777b83444281e696fea880f89fae71c8908451cd091107493c2bad715e283f2"
    },
    {
      "key": "07cac48",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Ви знайшли всі фотографії з мого путівника!",
      "sourceEnText": "You found all the photos from my guide!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_07cac48.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3396,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:13Z",
      "textHash": "b222b3e9fd8b77f07dca99f1e4b56bde06315b45fc540d7aa3c76070051cb8a0"
    },
    {
      "key": "07f732f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "міст для автомобілів",
      "sourceEnText": "a bridge for cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_07f732f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:57Z",
      "textHash": "bfb0a1bfac7755b401792fc6a1182fbb482ecf8c9862e05d4ebe856df32f93c1"
    },
    {
      "key": "0816b6b",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Залізничний міст має бути міцним.",
      "sourceEnText": "A train bridge must be strong.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0816b6b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2482,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:25Z",
      "textHash": "5f1731460fcc331dd553252fbea60dc46b452d304442f9b709fedc83464cc863"
    },
    {
      "key": "084c7e4",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Прогуляйтеся берегами Сени та знайдіть фотографії!",
      "sourceEnText": "Take a walk along the banks of the Seine and find the photos!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_084c7e4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3448,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:18Z",
      "textHash": "d3ec4ddb2a78934b5930daa0008ebcc7d70f392042af7b52b4ffcf1ecc7b79d8"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b0aea",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Я нарешті можу додому! У мене є ще одне запитання…",
      "sourceEnText": "I can finally go home! I have one last question…",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b0aea.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4807,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:15Z",
      "textHash": "abaec7bc3870e78db2ce66c9eaecc5babd10d4fd2ed3ef228196761edfa9adaa"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b1177",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Подивіться на цю карту Сени.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look at this map of the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b1177.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:58Z",
      "textHash": "8e8e4153ca1188a7c023e38fcba512f61dd1ecdfbe57a920adc6c1bae8fac1ac"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b4fad",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "для автомобілів",
      "sourceEnText": "for cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b4fad.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1358,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:44Z",
      "textHash": "7ebe664ae696eb12f27a6c713698534bb329326dc92654a80ce38804ffd304ae"
    },
    {
      "key": "08cc02a",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Важливі пам'ятники в Парижі були побудовані навколо Сени.",
      "sourceEnText": "Important monuments in Paris were built around the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08cc02a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3788,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:08Z",
      "textHash": "6f13f422059730d428f4955521024ebd57487237385de60450d9a0a6a24f83c4"
    },
    {
      "key": "08d8ef0",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Машини щодня перетинають річку.",
      "sourceEnText": "Cars cross the river every day.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08d8ef0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2482,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:28Z",
      "textHash": "b187d4f8d6ac31e5189a9983f155bc5e50d1339852caa2ad50346f0d6b4b516c"
    },
    {
      "key": "091e9fc",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Ви відкрили для себе мости та човни на Сені. Мости дозволяють вам перетнути річку, що протікає через Париж: Сену.",
      "sourceEnText": "You discovered the bridges and boats of the Seine. The bridges allow you to cross the river that flows through Paris: the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_091e9fc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 8516,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:03Z",
      "textHash": "181581fcc1230ebbec2c38697e821394af03d5ff6797051ac6490cfbe10049f4"
    },
    {
      "key": "09731f9",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Залізничний міст — це міст...",
      "sourceEnText": "A train bridge is a bridge...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09731f9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:41Z",
      "textHash": "df2fb7767510952d5b211e15a4b37a6a501cf085129fb4bf8edb4a030a1bd382"
    },
    {
      "key": "099fe86",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Це не правильна відповідь. Луара протікає через Нант, поблизу музею Жуля Верна.",
      "sourceEnText": "That's not the correct answer. The Loire flows through Nantes, near the Jules Verne Museum.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_099fe86.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6139,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:37Z",
      "textHash": "7402b94df2b3c6f145461e0c59b39367fc8f8ab0a2f68d976b4ae2bb6cd2f4ee"
    },
    {
      "key": "09c706f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Це міст Олександра III. Це дуже відомий міст.",
      "sourceEnText": "This is the Alexander III Bridge. It's a very famous bridge.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09c706f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3631,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:24Z",
      "textHash": "f339c6d6389f3280e098c35f1aaab055ffba279e713e7a043616127231b74b5d"
    },
    {
      "key": "09f3f7a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "Собака? Тут багато собак...",
      "sourceEnText": "A dog? There are many dogs here...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09f3f7a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:03Z",
      "textHash": "4013a3699ed428cb9225f13791739de8488f13720b6b80e161f5d039f4e2c432"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a0991d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Це міст для поїздів!",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a0991d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1724,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:39Z",
      "textHash": "e4a1c7130d288e0243d5e3ced8c86abf3d1d3b19d37408657c648f90487e3c8c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a29742",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Є хаусботи. Люди живуть на цих човнах. Їх називають баржами.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are houseboats. People live on these boats. They are called barges.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a29742.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5590,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:06Z",
      "textHash": "e881187788dcec002d92d0b6670564317d8d596e195ef4ef5da85831746d1ca4"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a2bcd3",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Так, це Сена. Річка, яка протікає через Париж, називається Сена.",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes, it's the Seine. The river that flows through Paris is called the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a2bcd3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5538,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:40Z",
      "textHash": "9984572930251d6a6fcf2e3f4c7d5956c37107ebb21830bf105f4c81f8d2b95e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a627c2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Цей човен — будинок. На цьому човні живуть люди. Цей човен називається хаусботом.",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat is a house. There are people who live on this boat. This boat is called a houseboat.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a627c2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7393,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:08Z",
      "textHash": "87d953363ab2030b8a537fa5227c173ed3158d9682ef02750172247c5a3da2a7"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a70250",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Дякую!",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a70250.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 888,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:11Z",
      "textHash": "ec3441d2e654ccf4f7434254cf831b63efa59e831bcf2f04c49bfca34ae20471"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a9c8e7",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Пройдіться біля річки, і ви знайдете ці фотографії!",
      "sourceEnText": "Walk near the river and you'll find the photos!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a9c8e7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4389,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:28Z",
      "textHash": "d08d5eaa82574474bf0666c6aaaa94efdc42469bc2c4b1d39ce7e0e1bd242d8e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0aa0f3a",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Допоможіть! Допоможіть мені!",
      "sourceEnText": "Help! Help me!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0aa0f3a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2299,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:23Z",
      "textHash": "e3be78cfdac1c782f509cdacd5dcde3b4af4fab9d1771fa217363ae847e8aeb9"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b12cb3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Товарне судно може перевозити: деревину, пісок, а також предмети: автомобілі, меблі...",
      "sourceEnText": "Boxes and things",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0b12cb3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 7549,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:47Z",
      "textHash": "2ddec0e0581b219ba32d69b4ffe6fdbc3b93b55e1b2b4496f0aa3e072816ec0d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b37e92",
      "nodeTitle": "post_quest_activity",
      "sourceText": "Намалюй міст у своєму зошиті!",
      "sourceEnText": "Draw a bridge in your notebook!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0b37e92.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:10Z",
      "textHash": "60d839b7d3ea3b75a9208acd907bd321e89aff35f5e1501199e477d471501920"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ba2f29",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Деякі мости призначені лише для пішоходів.",
      "sourceEnText": "Some bridges are intended for pedestrians only.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0ba2f29.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3135,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:27Z",
      "textHash": "0d149e2f99516f559d90be34a1d3b03ad591e95fbc2b5bd5f6c7d05ae4eccda6"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bbd3ce",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Туристи з фотоапаратами",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourists with cameras",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0bbd3ce.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:52Z",
      "textHash": "cef6c8994e2ef2c2899bd02af5d2f626d9d824a4a54888fcbc150a3af55114db"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bfcb05",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Якщо ви не можете їх знайти, ви можете скористатися картою Парижа, щоб знайти їх!",
      "sourceEnText": "If you can't find them, you can use the map of Paris to locate them!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0bfcb05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6113,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:20Z",
      "textHash": "406d71cbde82cc5cc05d401e4bdc39b8e4a3e23f550f9b045e6e8829758792f4"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c408c3",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Чудово, ви виконали це завдання!",
      "sourceEnText": "Great, you've completed this quest!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c408c3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:01Z",
      "textHash": "2c6e18b4e4364f1d13b409acc8961e97da7ae41ef3b4d63fdab4d68baf4949c9"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c86d26",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Там можливо жити.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's possible to live there.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c86d26.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1411,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:11Z",
      "textHash": "22ab47dd1164abf71a9ae528ac196f7cea37904a8325d681e654f99ed38891f5"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c8cdae",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Ви повинні йти по тротуару та переходити дорогу по пішохідному переходу.",
      "sourceEnText": "Use the sidewalk and cross at the crossing",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c8cdae.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5068,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:35Z",
      "textHash": "6ba9d8e478a0890446ee67bad2c2df196c42dd9104625a1dfe240607498bd229"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c8e7b6",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Сторінки моєї книги та фотографії впали біля Сени!",
      "sourceEnText": "The pages of my book and the photos fell near the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c8e7b6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3814,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:09:27Z",
      "textHash": "85597caf006dc03259c9327e39d60ed580e8225c179466e1d7e789f40f17329c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cf371b",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Тобі треба йти дорогою",
      "sourceEnText": "You have to walk on the road",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0cf371b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:10:38Z",
      "textHash": "ec95d7864d1b281bf969b7678b4f5fdc5e4983081c69ad2a5a3347e21f2f1779"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d1724c",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_river_friend",
      "sourceText": "Річка впадає в море.",
      "sourceEnText": "The river flows into the sea.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d1724c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "yaroslava",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:11:34Z",
      "textHash": "fde5c9ee190ad4602ce2811ad1c712310d54cb104473f1bc9d39741cae7263e6"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d79d7d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Це міст для машин!",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for cars!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d79d7d.mp3",
